@startuml
skinparam DefaultFontColor #1f2937
skinparam ArrowColor #5b6b8c
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1f2937
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam PackageBorderColor #94a3b8
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #eef2fb
skinparam ClassBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam ClassFontColor #1f2937
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #eef2fb
skinparam StateBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam StateFontColor #1f2937
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #eef2fb
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #eef2fb
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #fef3c7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #d97706
skinparam NoteFontColor #1f2937
' BrewLite A2 §4.2 - UC-04, SRS 3.4-3.6, FR-10..16, FR-20, NFR-05/06/13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F6F9FB
hide footbox
title BrewLite A2 - Sequence: UC-04 Checkout
autonumber
actor "Customer" as Customer
participant "Next.js UI" as UI
participant "NestJS API" as API
database "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "Payment Service\n(simulator)" as Pay

== E1a: entry and authentication ==
Customer -> UI : Open cart; press Checkout
alt No Customer JWT (E1a)
  UI --> Customer : Navigate /login?next=/checkout; retain cart
  Customer -> UI : Submit login
  UI -> API : POST /auth/login (credentials)
  API -> DB : Verify user and passwordHash
  DB --> API : User role CUSTOMER
  API --> UI : 200 JWT
  UI --> Customer : Return to /checkout with cart
else Already authenticated
  UI --> Customer : Show checkout summary
end
Customer -> UI : Select WALLET or CARD; confirm
UI -> UI : Validate input; disable confirm; generate Idempotency-Key

== UC-04.1: order creation ==
UI -> API : POST /orders (JWT, items: productId/size/toppings/quantity)
API -> API : JWT guard and role CUSTOMER
alt Missing / expired JWT (E1a)
  API --> UI : 401 UNAUTHORIZED; no Order
  UI --> Customer : Redirect /login?next=/checkout; keep cart
  Customer -> UI : Sign in as Customer
  UI -> API : POST /auth/login
  API --> UI : 200 refreshed JWT
  UI -> API : Retry POST /orders with SAME cart (no existing orderId)
  API -> API : Recheck JWT and CUSTOMER role
else Valid Customer JWT
end
API -> API : Validate DTO (BR-02); reject client prices (BR-01)
alt Bad DTO / unknown product (E6)
  API --> UI : 400 VALIDATION_ERROR / 404 PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND
  UI --> Customer : Fix cart; no Order created; stop checkout
else DTO accepted
  API -> DB : Read Product prices and options
  DB --> API : Product records
  API -> API : Compute unitPrice, lineTotal and Order.total
  group Transaction T1: recipe locks, ingredient reservation, snapshot (FR-11/13; NFR-13)
    API -> DB : BEGIN; lock recipes in ID order; read base + topping recipes\nAggregate ingredient quantities across ALL cart lines\nLock Ingredient rows in ID order; check onHand - reserved
    alt Missing/invalid recipe or ingredient shortage (E2)
      DB --> API : Recipe unavailable or aggregate ingredient shortage
      API -> DB : ROLLBACK (no Order, OrderItem, snapshot or balance change)
      API --> UI : 409 RECIPE_UNAVAILABLE / OUT_OF_STOCK + ingredient details
      UI --> Customer : Back to cart; highlight insufficient items
    else All recipes valid and aggregate demand fits
      API -> DB : Increase Ingredient.reserved; INSERT Order(PENDING, inventoryTracked=true)\nINSERT OrderItems and immutable aggregate OrderIngredient snapshot
      DB --> API : COMMIT T1; orderId, total
      API --> UI : 201 { id:orderId, status:PENDING, total }
      UI -> UI : Persist orderId/owner/key to continue same order
    end
  end
end
note over UI,API : Only the successful POST /orders branch continues to payment.

== UC-04.2: payment API ==
UI -> API : POST /payments (JWT, orderId, paymentMethod, cardNumber?)\nHeader Idempotency-Key
API -> API : JWT guard + CUSTOMER role
alt Expired JWT after Order exists (E1b)
  API --> UI : 401 UNAUTHORIZED; no Payment or new Order
  UI --> Customer : Re-login SAME account; retain cart, orderId and key
  Customer -> UI : Log in as original Customer
  UI -> API : POST /auth/login
  API --> UI : 200 new JWT
  UI -> API : GET /orders/:id (new JWT)
  API -> DB : Verify owner and load current order
  DB --> API : Current Order or ownership mismatch
  alt Different owner (403) / CANCELLED / already PAID+
    API --> UI : 403 or 200 current status
    UI --> Customer : Require original account or show current order\nNo additional POST /orders or charge
  else PENDING or PAYMENT_FAILED, owner verified
    API --> UI : 200 payable order
    UI -> API : Retry POST /payments SAME orderId and key (new JWT)
    API -> API : Revalidate Customer identity
  end
else JWT valid
end
API -> API : Validate payment DTO + key (E6)
API -> DB : BEGIN payment transaction; lock Order; verify owner (E7)
DB --> API : Order or 403/404
alt Invalid payment DTO/key or wrong order (E6/E7)
  API --> UI : 400 VALIDATION_ERROR / IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REQUIRED\nor 403 FORBIDDEN / 404 ORDER_NOT_FOUND
  UI --> Customer : Explain error; keep cart; no simulator call
else Valid body, owner verified
  API -> DB : Lookup SUCCESS by owner + orderId + key + paymentMethod (BR-05)
  DB --> API : Original SUCCESS or no cache match
  alt E4a: successful replay, API cache hit
    API --> UI : 200 original SUCCESS + same paymentId
    note over API,Pay : End transaction; cache return without simulator or balance changes.
    UI --> Customer : Show PAID receipt; clear cart
  else New payment request, no SUCCESS cache
    alt Order not PENDING/PAYMENT_FAILED (E4d/E7)
      API --> UI : 409 ORDER_NOT_PAYABLE; NO charge
      UI --> Customer : Show current order status
    else Order payable
      opt A3: retry after prior FAILED attempt
        API -> DB : Transition PAYMENT_FAILED -> PENDING
        DB --> API : Updated PENDING; snapshot/reserved unchanged; no new reservation
      end
      API -> Pay : charge(orderId, amount=Order.total, method)
      note right of Pay : Stateless simulator (SRS 3.4).\nDuplicate-charge guard lives in the API:\nSUCCESS replay (E4a) and ORDER_NOT_PAYABLE (E4d).
      alt E3: card declined
        Pay --> API : DECLINED (no money collected)
        group Persist failed attempt
          API -> DB : INSERT Payment(FAILED); UPDATE Order PAYMENT_FAILED
          DB --> API : Saved; onHand, reserved and snapshot unchanged
        end
        API --> UI : 402 PAYMENT_DECLINED
        UI --> Customer : Keep cart/orderId; offer Retry same Order (A3)
      else Payment SUCCESS
        Pay --> API : SUCCESS(transactionRef, amount, method)
        group Transaction T2: locked Order + snapshot consumption + payment
          API -> DB : Within locked Order transaction; lock ingredients in ID order\nDecrease onHand AND reserved by immutable snapshot\nINSERT Payment(SUCCESS, idempotencyKey); UPDATE Order -> PAID; COMMIT
          DB --> API : One Payment SUCCESS; Order PAID
        end
        note over API,DB : E8b: API stops before COMMIT -> Order stays PENDING;\nretry is a new attempt (accepted risk, simulated money, SRS 3.4).
        API --> UI : 201 {orderId, paymentId, status:SUCCESS,\norderStatus:PAID, amount}
        UI -> UI : Clear cart
        UI --> Customer : Show paid receipt, order code, tracking (FR-20)
      end
    end
  end
end

== UC-06: owner cancellation of unpaid order (FR-25 Must) ==
opt Owner chooses cancel while PENDING / PAYMENT_FAILED
  Customer -> UI : Confirm cancel
  UI -> API : PATCH /orders/:id {status:CANCELLED} + JWT
  API -> DB : BEGIN; lock Order; check owner and transition
  alt Valid unpaid order, inventoryTracked=true
    API -> DB : Lock ingredients in ID order; decrease reserved by snapshot\nKeep onHand unchanged; set CANCELLED; COMMIT
    API --> UI : 200 CANCELLED
  else Legacy inventoryTracked=false
    API -> DB : Restore original Product.stock quantities; set CANCELLED; COMMIT
    API --> UI : 200 CANCELLED; no ingredient changes
  else Repeated cancel / paid / wrong owner
    API -> DB : ROLLBACK; no balance changes
    API --> UI : 409 invalid state / 403 forbidden
  end
end
note over API,DB
  Legacy false-marker orders preserve original Product.stock payment/cancel lifecycle.
  New true-marker orders use snapshot, never current recipes for consume/release.
  No automatic cancellation or reservation expiry.
end note
@enduml
